                                "tr": "Fabrika kapandı ve <w>bunun sonucunda</w> kasabadaki birçok insan işini kaybetti.",
                                "es": "La fábrica cerró y, <w>como resultado</w>, muchas personas en el pueblo perdieron sus empleos.",
                                "zh": "工厂倒闭了，<w>因此</w>镇上许多人都失业了。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "She lost her passport and <w>subsequently</w> could not travel to the conference.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
